 panel.innerHTML=tr("<h3>问题记录：起跳和滚转被高度门槛拆开了</h3><p class=\"small\">旧版先升到米级高度才发出滚转指令。本次离地后开始慢转，同时积累上升动量。下表区分指令、喷口实际力矩和车体运动，硬件、供气、初态相同。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>策略</th><th>起升检测</th><th>首次滚转指令</th><th>实际喷气力矩</th><th>车体开始转动</th><th>指令净升高</th><th>竖直速度</th><th>剩余气压</th></tr>","<h3>Issue record: the height gate separated liftoff from roll</h3><p class=\"small\">The old controller waited until meter-scale height before commanding roll. This version starts slow roll after liftoff while building upward momentum. The table separates commands, actual nozzle torque and body motion with identical hardware, supply and initial state.</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>Policy</th><th>Liftoff detected</th><th>First roll command</th><th>Actual jet torque</th><th>Body rotation begins</th><th>Net rise at command</th><th>Vertical velocity</th><th>Remaining pressure</th></tr>")+rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${keys[r.comparison]??r.comparison}</td><td>${round(r.takeoff?.t)} s</td><td>${round(r.firstNonzeroRollCommand?.t)} s</td><td>${round(r.firstRealizedRollTorque?.t)} s</td><td>${round(r.firstRollMotion?.t)} s</td><td>${round(r.firstNonzeroRollCommand?.riseAboveInitialCG,3)} m</td><td>${round(r.firstNonzeroRollCommand?.verticalVelocity)} m/s</td><td>${round((r.firstNonzeroRollCommand?.pressureRatio??NaN)*100,1)}%</td></tr>`).join('')+tr("</table></div><div class=\"transport\"><button id=\"compare-gate\">旧版 vs 只提前启动</button><button id=\"compare-retrained\">旧版 vs 重新训练</button><button id=\"jump-roll\">查看右侧首次滚转指令</button></div><p class=\"small\">起升检测指无轮接触、正在上升且重心较初态抬高至少1 mm。指令与实际喷口力矩以10 N·m为门槛，转动以车体角速度0.05 rad/s为门槛。时刻分辨率20 ms，实际喷力含阀门滞后。左右竖直喷口差动也能产生滚转力矩，不能仅凭喷口在车身侧面判断作用。<a href=\"research/training-lessons.html\">问题记录 ↗</a> · <a href=\"failure-library.html\">失败视频素材 ↗</a></p>","</table></div><div class=\"transport\"><button id=\"compare-gate\">Old version vs early start only</button><button id=\"compare-retrained\">Old version vs retrained</button><button id=\"jump-roll\">View first right-side roll command</button></div><p class=\"small\">Liftoff detection requires no wheel contact, upward motion and CoM rise of at least 1 mm. Command and actual nozzle torque use a 10 N·m threshold; body rotation uses 0.05 rad/s. Time resolution is 20 ms; actual thrust includes valve lag. Differential vertical nozzles can also create roll torque; side placement alone does not establish a nozzle’s role.<a href=\"research/training-lessons.html\">Issue record ↗</a> · <a href=\"failure-library.html\">Failure video assets ↗</a></p>");
